1
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:13,452
Most jobs are for somebody. Say
who, and half the form fills itself.

2
00:00:15,063 --> 00:00:19,939
The client picker is there wherever
the workspace keeps a client book.

3
00:00:20,391 --> 00:00:26,681
Choose one, and the place comes with
them. Nobody types an address anybody could

4
00:00:26,681 --> 00:00:27,311
mistype.

5
00:00:27,765 --> 00:00:33,390
If that address has never been pinned, it
says so — and the map underneath is where

6
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:36,914
that is fixed, once, for
every visit after this one.

7
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:41,968
And the visit joins everything
else you have ever done for them.

8
00:00:42,423 --> 00:00:47,206
Next: the things the
company owns, and who has them.

